  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"462\" id=\"isPasted\">• <strong data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"25\">Brand introduction:</strong><br data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"28\">Nitesights is a UK company with one simple goal: give casual airsofters clear vision in the dark without the four-figure price tag. Our digital IR night-vision kits are built for weekend skirmishes and CQB, not for gear-snobs chasing thousand-pound analogue tubes. <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"462\">This programme is for content creators and influencers only; coupon sites, browser extensions, and cashback platforms will be moved to our separate “Voucher-Site Partners” program with commission of 3%.</strong></p><p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"878\">• <strong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"490\">Product description:</strong><br data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"493\">The <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"536\">“Nitesights ELITE New Recruit Pack”</strong> bundles everything you need: the ELITE monocular (lag-free digital NV to ~100 yards), a free helmet, rhino mount with J-arm, and a Picatinny rail mount. Its 2 mm metal housing is battle-ready, and at <strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"748\">£169.95</strong> the pack is unmatched for what’s in the box. Most orders land between <strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"832\">£170–£190</strong> when customers add accessories or warranties.</p><p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1134\">• <strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"913\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"916\">Lag-free 60 Hz digital NV; compact at 5 in / 236 g; complete starter kit included free; featured in <em data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1032\">Airsoft Action</em> magazine; free worldwide shipping, 30-day money-back guarantee, and a 12-month lens-covered warranty.</p><p data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1311\">• <strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1156\">Payment terms:</strong><br data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1159\">Earn <strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1172\">10 %</strong> of every sale (pre-VAT &amp; shipping). 30-day cookie. Payout on the 1st of each month via PayPal or UK bank/Wise once earnings reach <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1310\">£25</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1563\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">• <strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1337\">Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1340\">Need assets? We supply lifestyle photos, unboxing clips, and NV/IR footage on request. Personalised links and vanity codes available. Please avoid PPC bids on “Nitesights” or close variants, and keep codes off coupon sites.</p></div></div>",
